msgid ""
"Reusable shell commands for the current keymap. On Linux they run through sh"
" -lc after you explicitly allow them. Shell commands run one at a time, with"
" a 30-second limit, in your home directory."
msgstr "當前 Keymap 的可複用 shell 命令。在 Linux 上，經您明確允許後透過 sh -lc 執行。Shell 命令在您的主目錄中逐個執行，每個限時 30 秒。"

